# Per-Dockerfile ignore for the ISOLATED Guide build (Gate D3).
#
# BuildKit uses this file INSTEAD of the root .dockerignore when building guide/Dockerfile. The
# root .dockerignore excludes guide/ + data/ (correct for the APP image), which would starve the
# Guide build of its own package. Here we keep the context to the Guide package ONLY — no vigil/,
# no app code, no data/ (the vendored MiniLM weights are BIND-MOUNTED read-only at runtime, not
# baked in). This preserves the Guide's import-isolation: nothing from vigil.* can enter the image.
*
!guide
guide/data
guide/Dockerfile
guide/Dockerfile.dockerignore
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
